For the first time without cheats, I've made it to Gehennom. I am
unstoppable. I've found the Vibrating Square and I'm ready to ascend.

But the Wizard did not yield the Book of the Dead when I killed him. I
have two fake Amulets as spoils, but no papyrus spellbook. Nor is it
anywhere else on the level, nor is the Wizard.

I have narrowed it down to the following possibilities:
1. The original Wizard is still alive and Double Troubled one more time
than I thought. He has fled the level with the Book of the Dead and I
will see him later.
2. The Nethack gods have frowned upon the idea of me ever ascending. If
they can't kill me, then they must introduce a bug that prevents me
from obtaining the Amulet.
3. The Wizard's AI has evolved and become spiteful. When he saw that he
was near death, he levelported and dropped the Book off in, say, Mine's
End, then 'ported back to meet his doom. He died smiling, knowing that
I would never ever locate the Book.

My fingers are crossed for option #1, but AFAIK baddies don't escape
the level unless you've cornered them on a staircase. Is there
something I'm missing?



